          "description": "Move objects between hands",
          "description_hi": "वस्तुओं को हाथों में बदलें",
          "description_ta": "பொருட்களைக் கைகளுக்கு மாற்றவும்"
        },
        {
          "id": "vcg4_5_5",
          "name": "Coordinated Movement",
          "name_hi": "समन्वित गति",
